      "## 3. CROSS-CUTTING FACTS YOU SHOULD CITE\n",
      "\n",
      "- **Local embedding models make \"never for memory\" airtight.** `nomic-embed-text` (**274 MB, 62.28 MTEB**) is the CPU-only default; `embeddinggemma-300m` is explicitly \"on-device/offline/CPU\"; `qwen3-embedding:0.6b` (**639 MB, 64.33**) is the strongest sub-1 GB option; `qwen3-embedding:8b` (**70.58**, needs GPU). All run under Ollama/llama.cpp → **embedding generation never touches an API**.\n",
