      "- **Footprint reality check:** for a single user's job corpus (resume + a few thousand JDs + feedback = likely <100K vectors), **SQLite-vec ≈ 50 MB RAM / LanceDB ≈ 120 MB RAM**, i.e. trivial next to a local LLM's own RAM.\n",
