      "**Emerging front-runner (to be formalized next):** a **single-file SQLite core** = relational profile tables + FTS5 + `sqlite-vec` (hybrid semantic), optionally a **lightweight graph edge table (or Graphiti+FalkorDB-lite) only if temporal preference reasoning proves necessary**, with **local embeddings via Ollama** and **Tavily scoped strictly to live JD fetches written back into the SQLite cache**.\n",
